@startuml
title Story Runtime 구조와 책임 경계
caption Architecture Spec: Sections 1, 2, 5, 8, 12, 13, 24, 25
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
package "rule-knowledge-service" {
  class "Scenario Source" as Source
  class "Source Evidence" as Evidence
}
package "adventure-service / Scenario Preparation" {
  class "Scenario Package" as Package
  class "Stage Backbone" as Backbone
  class "Detailed Stage" as Detailed
  class "Situation Candidate" as Candidate
}
package "adventure-service / Adventure Runtime" {
  class "Runtime Narrative State" as State
  class "Runtime Binding" as Binding
  class "Runtime Turn Coordinator" as Coordinator
  class "Canonical Proposal Validator" as Validator
}
package "ai-game-master-service" {
  class "AI Game Master" as GM
}
class "Mechanical Owning Services" as Mechanical
Source --> Evidence : 조회
Evidence --> Package : 근거 포함
Package --> Backbone : 파생
Package --> Detailed : 파생
Backbone --> Detailed : 현재 Stage materialize
Detailed --> Candidate : Stage Intent 기반 생성
Binding --> Package
Binding --> Backbone
Binding --> Detailed
State --> Backbone : 현재 리비전
State --> Detailed : 현재 snapshot
Coordinator --> GM : context
GM --> Validator : state-changing proposal
Validator --> State : 검증 후 확정
Coordinator --> Mechanical : mechanical command 위임
note bottom of Validator
AI는 저장 권한 없음.
Runtime만 canonical state 확정.
end note
@enduml
